#: ../../tools/opentree_tools.rst:61 54c86a9b33ed45179a947d7c4f598cdb
msgid "**Name**: ``OpenTree_get_mrca``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/opentree_tools.rst:63 e51a64ec53af42ce8f45a494046b1441
msgid ""
"**Description**: Find the Most Recent Common Ancestor (MRCA) of a set of "
"taxa in the Open Tree of Life synthetic phylogeny. Takes two or more OTT "
"IDs and returns their MRCA with its taxonomic name and rank. Essential "
"for understanding evolutionary relationships between species. Example: "
"OTT IDs 770315 (Homo sapiens) and 417950 (Pan troglodytes) gives MRCA in "
"subfamily Homininae."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/opentree_tools.rst:67 7ee6bebfb45b4a73888e18924550a70e
msgid ""
"``ott_ids`` (string) (required) Comma-separated OTT IDs (at least 2). Use"
" OpenTree\\_match\\_names to get IDs. Examples: '770315,417950' (human + "
"chimp), '770315,417950,158484' (human + chimp + bonobo), '244265,417950' "
"(fruit fly + chimp)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/opentree_tools.rst:84 a3d9344778cb4debb49606aa498cdfc4
